{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"739055105604714506","content":"After spending the day tidying up after the party, Ozgur sits down on his porch and lets out a content sigh. The creature beneath the sheet tweets at him as he starts to doze off. \"Ah roight, time for beddy-Bie.\" Ozgur rises and refills the birdseed, before climbing into bed. He should really get this \"Trapped within a hard metal shell of which there is no escape\" situation delt with. But he can endure it. Just a few more days...","created_at":"2020-08-19T04:16:00.288000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745496265256730717","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"739055105604714506","content":"Ozgur pauses and slams the head of his axe into the cutting block, nearly sundering it. He goes to wipe the sweat from his brow and stops when he feels cold metal, letting out a tired chuckle as he does so. He turns and looks back at the **Large** pile of firewood behind him. \n\"That was a gud workout.\" He says with a grin. The creature beneath the sheet twitters back from inside as Ozgur prepares to turn in for the night.","created_at":"2020-08-20T06:29:51.495000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745892338445975552","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"739055105604714506","content":"Ozgur wakes up with a yawn. He starts to go through his daily routine, but he keeps getting distracted thinking about the coming storm. \"It's almost here. Almost.\" Ozgur heads towards town.","created_at":"2020-08-20T15:34:06.844000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746029304906776727","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"739055105604714506","content":"Ozgur wakes up. There is a ringing in his ears. He realizes that it is the creature beneath the sheet, tweeting loudly. He smiles staring up at the ceiling. \"Today is the day.\" Ozgur gets out of bed. He appraches the brass birdcage and gently lifts the sheet, just a bit, he whispers *\"Don't come out today. Wait for me to return. If I don't, well...\"* Ozgur sits quietly for a moment. \"I will come back. I promise.\" He says with a smile. He grabs his things, and looks around the Warenui, one last time, at the Tekoteko meant to protect this place and his tribe, at the carved face of his grandfather. His face takes on a look of grim determination as he starts to head towards town.","created_at":"2020-08-21T16:05:44.914000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746399653855232011","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"739055105604714506","content":"In the Warenui. A small hand unlocks the birdcage from the inside. And from beneath the sheet, steps a small, Yellow Kobold, wearing blue overalls. A pair of goggles perched atop his head. On his shoulder sits a Canary. The Kobold looks around with worry. \"Oz-Gor?\"","created_at":"2020-08-22T06:56:33.962000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746623835410923610","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
